<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classLtpUdpEngineManager" kindref="compound">LtpUdpEngineManager</ref> class is singleton pattern class used to share UDP sockets that bind to the same UDP port with various <ref refid="classLtpUdpEngine" kindref="compound">LtpUdpEngine(s)</ref>. It manages a bidirectional udp socket paired with its own boost::asio::io_service and thread. It quickly examines the first few bytes of incoming UDP packets so that it can route them to their proper <ref refid="classLtpUdpEngine" kindref="compound">LtpUdpEngine</ref>. </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
